### Old smoke check ###
GET localhost:8180/control/agent/tools/telegram
x-api-key: ***REMOVED***


### --- LLM providers (management, JWT) --- ###

### Create LLM provider (OpenAI)
POST http://localhost:8180/control/manage/llm-providers/
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Production OpenAI",
  "providerType": "OPENAI",
  "apiKey": "sk-replace-me-with-real-key",
  "enabled": true
}

### List LLM providers
GET http://localhost:8180/control/manage/llm-providers/
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Get LLM provider
GET http://localhost:8180/control/manage/llm-providers/{{llmProviderPubId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Update LLM provider (rotate api_key)
PATCH http://localhost:8180/control/manage/llm-providers/{{llmProviderPubId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiKey": "sk-new-rotated-key"
}

### Refresh available models
POST http://localhost:8180/control/manage/llm-providers/{{llmProviderPubId}}/refresh-models
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Delete LLM provider (cascades to agent bindings)
DELETE http://localhost:8180/control/manage/llm-providers/{{llmProviderPubId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}


### --- Agent ↔ LLM bindings (management, JWT) --- ###

### Create the CHAT binding (agent-loop model)
POST http://localhost:8180/control/manage/agents/{{agentPubId}}/llms/
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "llmProviderPubId": "{{llmProviderPubId}}",
  "model": "gpt-4o",
  "purpose": "CHAT"
}

### Create the VISION binding (media model-as-tool)
POST http://localhost:8180/control/manage/agents/{{agentPubId}}/llms/
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "llmProviderPubId": "{{llmProviderPubId}}",
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "purpose": "VISION"
}

### List bindings
GET http://localhost:8180/control/manage/agents/{{agentPubId}}/llms/
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Replace binding (change model)
PUT http://localhost:8180/control/manage/agents/{{agentPubId}}/llms/CHAT
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "llmProviderPubId": "{{llmProviderPubId}}",
  "model": "gpt-4o-2024-11-20"
}

### Delete binding
DELETE http://localhost:8180/control/manage/agents/{{agentPubId}}/llms/VISION
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}


### --- Agent runtime (X-Api-Key) --- ###

### List all LLM bindings (with decrypted apiKey)
GET http://localhost:8180/control/agent/llm
x-api-key: ***REMOVED***

### Get one binding by purpose
GET http://localhost:8180/control/agent/llm/CHAT
x-api-key: ***REMOVED***
